/*==============================================================

 PB AR059 RECOVERY DETAIL BY REPORT REGION

 Report Region examples:

     Austin
     Brenham
     College Station
     Hill Country
     HPS
     HTPN WO&M
     HTPN JV
     Marble Falls
     Temple
     Round Rock
     etc.

 This version:

 1. Loads the authorized PB facility structure.
 2. Defines the verified PB Report Region GroupCategoryIDs.
 3. Maps every authorized PB facility to Report Region.
 4. Retains Specialty and AU from Facility Structure.
 5. Prevents duplicate Report Region assignment.
 6. Runs the existing PB AR059 procedure for six ranges.
 7. Returns Report Region summaries and complete detail.
 8. Captures unmapped AR059 facility diagnostics.

==============================================================*/


